                'note' => 'All plastics are prohibited, as are cooking oil, fishing gear and incinerator ash from plastics. Ground food waste (25 mm) at 3 NM or more; other food waste at 12 NM or more; cargo residues (non-HME) at 12 NM or more; animal carcasses at 100 NM or more.',
